Description: Add a voidElements option
 Names extra elements that never have content or a close tag, like <br>.
 The names are matched without regard to case against one set built from
 upstream's list and the option.
Author: Numiko
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Test: test/parser/parse-for-eslint.test.ts (Drupal placeholders)
Last-Update: 2026-11-04
---
